WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.273
In Microsoft Fabric be careful about which SQL
surface you are using A

00:00:06.286 --> 00:00:12.247
Spark notebook or Spark SQL cell runs through Spark
A SQL analytics

00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:19.469
endpoint uses a different SQL serving surface often
with T-SQL style behavior Some

00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:25.116
syntax and capabilities differ When code fails first
check which engine you are

00:00:25.129 --> 00:00:25.998
actually using
